      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A customizer that can be implemented by beans wishing to customize the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/reactive/server/WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a> to fine-tune its auto-configuration before a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/reactive/server/WebTestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient</code></a> is created.",
      "translation": "一个自定义器，可由希望自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/reactive/server/WebTestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient.Builder</code></a> 的 Bean 实现，以便在创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/reactive/server/WebTestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient</code></a> 之前对其自动配置进行微调。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Annotation that can be applied to a test class to enable a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/reactive/server/WebTestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.reactive.server\"><code>WebTestClient</code></a>.",
